"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[83061],{83061:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<BookCard \\n          cover=\\"/assets/snippets/books/gomtang-2.png\\"\\n          title=\\"Gomtang 2: The Night Twelve People Disappeared\\"\\n          author=\\"Kim Young-tak\\"\\n          publisher=\\"Arte\\"\\n          publishedDate=\\"2021-05-13\\"\\n          isbn=\\"9788950995461\\"\\n          rating=4.5\\n          tags=\\"thriller\\"\\n        />\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nLike a movie director, it is fast-paced.  \\nIt retrieves the \'bait\' (foreshadowing) carefully piled up in volume 1 and develops the story quickly.  \\n<br>\\nMany people are sacrificed to build the utopia they think of.  \\nDoes ```Utopia``` really exist?\\n<br>\\nA Korean-style time-leap work, the story development is fast and the probability of the stories seems high.  \\nA book I want to recommend to many. Since this book, personal prejudices against Korean novels seem to have disappeared.  \\n"}')}}]);